{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網上近日流傳一段車Cam影片，直擊吐露港公路發生一宗電單車自炒意外。事發時現場正值下雨，車Cam司機駕駛車輛沿中線行駛，期間有一輛電單車在快線快速駛過。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-30-11h02m37s396.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026CMOxF5ChJC1785381193.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-30-11h02m37s396.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">據片段顯示，當時快線行車道上有一個大水氹。當該名鐵騎士駛過水氹時，現場頓時濺起高高的水花。隨後畫面一轉，該輛電單車懷疑失控自炒，鐵騎士整個人頓時被甩出，跌在快線旁邊，影片隨即結束。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-30-11h02m49s397.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20264M8cVcSTXM1785381193.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-30-11h02m49s397.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">上載影片的網民在帖文中留言表示：「大埔入粉嶺，電單車快線自炒，希望平安無事。」影片曝光後隨即引發網絡熱議，不少網民指出下雨天時駕駛電單車必須打醒十二分精神，特別要留意行車道旁的水氹積水，紛紛留言討論：「大埔入粉嶺 電單車快線自炒，希望平安無事」、「尤其下大雨天沙田馬場右邊快線往大埔方向更加危險，積水情況嚴重」、「通常快線好多水氹，26 仲要行」、「落大雨，行快線，盲彎位，無嘢好講！」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-30-11h02m52s902.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20264cCssX7dc31785381193.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-30-11h02m52s902.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-30-11h02m56s735.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026oJnrd78jKh1785381194.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-30-11h02m56s735.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T03:38:29.319470+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":361,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}